Anlogic top config
===============================

Anlogic top config is used to access top registers of Anlogic SoCs.

Required properties:
- compatible: Shall contain one of the following :
			"anlogic,dr1x90-topcfg" for dr1x90 SoCs
- reg: base address and size of the top register space.

Example:
	topcfg: topcfg@f8800000 {
		compatible = "anlogic,dr1x90-topcfg";
		reg = <0x0 0xf8800000 0 0x1000>;
		status = "okay";
	};
